ce anyone asked me that. I'll be rustier than Crabface, but I can read a little.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sang-Ha cant? Been years since anyone asked me that. I'll be rustier than Crabface, but I can read a little.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31404","byteOffset":19761480,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_984B3329","articyId":"72057611218075442","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Hmm, this belonged to a clipper sailing out of Sangport. Can tell by the markings. As for the name… umm… Caramel Bee? Annabel Free?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hmm, this belonged to a clipper sailing out of Sangport. Can tell by the markings. As for the name… umm… Caramel Bee? Annabel Free?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2849.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30636","byteOffset":19470032,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_9E4A1781","articyId":"72057611218075456","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"That’s it! Thought you couldn’t read this?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That’s it! Thought you couldn’t read this?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33623","byteOffset":20603368,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_CA187B7B","articyId":"72057611218075470","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Aye, aye. There are folk who’ll always be